# Idle Game Patterns

Opt-in rules for idle/combat/progression features.

## Auto combat loop

- Heroes attack on independent `Timer` nodes, not frame-based `_process`
- Enemy attacks on separate timer (`INTERVALO_ATAQUE_INIMIGO ≈ 1.35s`)
- Target rightmost living hero (`indice_alvo_direita`)
- Gate all combat actions when `_resolvendo_morte` or `_resolvendo_derrota`

## Stat recalculation

Recalculate on events, not every frame:

- Equipment changed
- Skill tree node purchased
- Hero level-up
- Party composition changed

Flow: `recalcular_atributos()` → `party.recalcular_status()` → HUD refresh signal

## Rewards

- Gold: base × random variance × tree `bonus_ouro`
- XP: shared to all active party classes × tree `bonus_xp`
- Items: 30% drop chance, level-scaled via `ItemDatabase`
- Show coin VFX before applying gold (`efeito_moedas_pedido` then `ouro_ganho`)

## Progression

- World index: `(mundo-1)*9 + fase` drives enemy scaling
- `repetir_fase` farms current stage but still unlocks `fases_liberadas`
- Difficulty tiers gate on full completion of previous tier

## Persistence

- Autosave every 30s + on inventory close + on combat milestones
- Aggregate state in single `collect_save()` dictionary — avoid partial saves from panels
- v4 will add hero skill equipment persistence

## UX for idle

- Combat runs while inventory open (unless explicitly paused)
- Transparent overlay: click-through when menus closed
- Toast/aviso for unlocks (world, difficulty) — prefer i18n keys

